---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import ServicePricing from '../../../components/ServicePricing.astro';
import { getServicePricing } from '../../../data/service-prices';
import { getLangFromUrl, useTranslations } from '../../../i18n/utils';

const lang = getLangFromUrl(Astro.url);
const t = useTranslations(lang);
const pricing = getServicePricing('dishwasher', 'varna', lang);

const title = 'Dishwasher Repair & Installation in Varna | RotoRem';
const description = 'In-home dishwasher repair and installation service in Varna - Quality guarantee - All brands - Same-day repair - Call 089 834 0982!';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <article class="">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-emerald-800 text-white py-16 mb-16">
      <div class="container max-w-4xl text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">
          Dishwasher Repair and Installation in Varna
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-emerald-100 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8">
          Professional dishwasher repair in Varna and surrounding areas. Fast on-site service with quality guarantee.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-emerald-100 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">
          Visit and diagnostics in Varna - 20 EUR
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
          <a href="mailto:n.ivanov.ivanov@abv.bg" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-white text-emerald-600 px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors shadow-lg">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
              <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
            </svg>
            Send Email
          </a>
          <a href="tel:0898340982" class="bg-amber-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-amber-600 transition-colors shadow-lg">
            Call 089 834 0982
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container max-w-4xl">

      <!-- Why Choose Us Section -->
      <section class="mb-16">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Why choose our dishwasher repair service in Varna?</h2>
          <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-emerald-500 mx-auto"></div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-emerald-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-emerald-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path>
                <polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-emerald-900 mb-3">Fast on-site repair</h3>
            <p class="text-emerald-800">Our technician comes directly to your home in Varna to repair your dishwasher. No need to remove the appliance.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-green-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-green-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-green-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
                <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-green-900 mb-3">Same-day repair</h3>
            <p class="text-green-800">In most cases we repair dishwashers the same day in Varna. Quick diagnosis and efficient problem resolution.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-amber-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-amber-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-amber-900 mb-3">Quality guarantee</h3>
            <p class="text-amber-800">All dishwasher repairs in Varna are performed with a guarantee for work quality.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-50 to-teal-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-teal-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-teal-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z"></path>
                <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-teal-900 mb-3">Service throughout Varna</h3>
            <p class="text-teal-800">We repair dishwashers in neighborhoods: Chayka, Mladost, Asparuhovo, Levski, Vladislav Varnenchik and Varna center.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-50 to-cyan-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-cyan-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-cyan-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18"/><path d="M8 16v-4"/><path d="M16 16v-4"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-cyan-900 mb-3">All dishwasher brands</h3>
            <p class="text-cyan-800">We repair dishwashers from all brands: Bosch, Siemens, Electrolux, Whirlpool, Indesit, Candy and others.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-lime-50 to-lime-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-lime-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-lime-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"></line>
                <path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-lime-900 mb-3">Fair prices</h3>
            <p class="text-lime-800">Visit and diagnostics: Varna - 20 EUR. Clear prices with no hidden fees for dishwasher repair in Varna.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Common Problems Section -->
      <section class="mb-16">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Most common dishwasher problems in Varna</h2>
          <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-emerald-500 mx-auto"></div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-50 via-white to-emerald-50 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-emerald-100">
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md border-l-4 border-emerald-500">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-emerald-900 mb-3">Dishwasher leaking water</h3>
              <p class="text-emerald-800">Leaks from the bottom, door or hoses. Our technician will quickly find and fix the leak.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md border-l-4 border-blue-500">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-blue-900 mb-3">Dishwasher not draining water</h3>
              <p class="text-blue-800">Problem with the drain pump or filter blockage. Professional cleaning and repair.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md border-l-4 border-red-500">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-red-900 mb-3">Dishwasher not heating water</h3>
              <p class="text-red-800">Damaged heater or thermostat. Replacement with original or compatible spare parts.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md border-l-4 border-amber-500">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-amber-900 mb-3">Dishwasher not turning on</h3>
              <p class="text-amber-800">Electrical problems, damaged contacts or control board. Diagnosis and repair in Varna.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md border-l-4 border-purple-500">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-purple-900 mb-3">Dishwasher not cleaning well</h3>
              <p class="text-purple-800">Clogged nozzles, worn parts or water pressure problems. We restore full functionality.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md border-l-4 border-indigo-500">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-indigo-900 mb-3">Dishwasher making noise</h3>
              <p class="text-indigo-800">Worn pumps, loose parts or foreign objects. We eliminate all causes of noise.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {pricing && <ServicePricing pricing={pricing} accent="emerald" />}

      <!-- Brands Section - Clean text-focused approach -->
      <section class="mb-16">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Dishwasher brands we repair in Varna</h2>
          <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-emerald-500 mx-auto"></div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-50 to-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
            {[
              'Bosch', 'Siemens', 'Electrolux', 'Whirlpool', 
              'Indesit', 'Candy', 'Miele', 'Other brands'
            ].map((brand) => (
              <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg text-center shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border border-gray-200 group hover:border-emerald-300">
                <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-emerald-600 transition-colors">
                  {brand}
                </h4>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">
                  {brand === 'Other brands' ? 'All other brands' : `${brand} repair service`}
                </p>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Final CTA -->
      <section class="text-center bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-emerald-800 text-white p-12 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Need dishwasher repair in Varna?</h2>
        <p class="text-xl mb-8 text-emerald-100">Call now for fast on-site repair!</p>
        
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center mb-6">
          <a href="mailto:n.ivanov.ivanov@abv.bg" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-white text-emerald-600 px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors shadow-lg">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
              <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
            </svg>
            Send Email
          </a>
          <a href="tel:0898340982" class="bg-amber-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-amber-600 transition-colors shadow-lg">
            Call 089 834 0982
          </a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="text-emerald-100">
          <p class="text-sm">
            Visit and diagnostics: Varna - 20 EUR | Quality guarantee | Service in Varna
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

<!-- SEO helper text -->
      <div class="rotorem-seo-text">
        <p>Is your dishwasher not draining, not starting, or leaving dishes dirty? These are problems that require quick action. We provide in-home dishwasher repair in Varna without unnecessary waiting or transporting the appliance. We work on-site in the city and nearby areas with diagnostics, repair, and dishwasher installation when needed.</p>
        <h2>What dishwasher faults we repair in Varna</h2>
        <p>Most clients contact us when the machine stops working properly. Common issues include not draining water, not heating, not starting a program, dirty dishes after cycles, unusual noise, leaks, and display errors. In such cases, quick and accurate diagnostics by an experienced technician is essential.</p>
        <p>Besides standard dishwasher service, we also provide built-in dishwasher installation, including built-in door panel mounting and setup according to your kitchen layout. Whether it is a new appliance or an issue with an existing one, you can rely on our practical experience.</p>
        <p>If you need other repairs as well, you can check our <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/services/washing-machine-repair/">washing machine repair</a>, <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/services/oven-repair/">oven repair</a>, and the complete <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/services/">Varna service catalog</a>.</p>
        <h2>Which dishwasher brands we service in Varna</h2>
        <p>We work with all popular manufacturers, including Bosch, Whirlpool, Samsung, Indesit, Miele, Electrolux, and others. We know the specifics of different models, including built-in systems, which allows fast diagnostics and effective repair without unnecessary trial and error.</p>
        <h2>Areas in Varna we cover</h2>
        <p>RotoRem dishwasher service covers all districts of Varna and nearby areas up to about 20 km. We work in Chaika, Levski, Vladislav Varnenchik, Mladost, Asparuhovo, Galata, and the central area, with fast response whenever possible.</p>
        <h2>How the repair process works</h2>
        <p>The process starts with an on-site visit and diagnostics to identify the exact issue. Then you receive a clear quote based on the situation. After approval, we proceed with part replacement, adjustment, or installation as required.</p>
        <p>After the repair, we run tests to confirm proper operation. For built-in models, we also ensure correct leveling, connections, and proper front panel fit.</p>
        <h2>Why choose RotoRem for dishwasher service</h2>
        <p>Clients choose a reliable dishwasher service when they want a secure solution without wasting time. RotoRem has over 15 years of practical appliance repair experience and works directly at your address, saving transport and hassle. You get clear conditions from the start, no hidden fees, and warranty-backed repairs. <a href="https://www.rotorem.bg/contact/">Contact us</a> now and book a convenient visit.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>

